#~ "High-performance built-in media player powered by MPV.\n"
#~ "• Shortcut: Ctrl+Y to play a direct URL.\n"
#~ "• Controls: Space for play/pause, arrows to seek, Ctrl+Arrows for volume boost up to 200%, brackets [ and ] for playback speed, Ctrl+E for Equalizer, and Ctrl+C to navigate chapters."

#~ msgid ""
