#~ "• Shortcut: Ctrl+D from any window.\n"
#~ "• Formats: Supports MP4 video at various resolutions (up to 4K), or MP3/M4A audio.\n"
#~ "• Automated: Background downloads with spoken announcements and live progress percentages."

